    <string name="oem_steps_xiaomi">Security app → Permissions → Autostart: turn KAIRO on. Then Settings → Apps → KAIRO → Battery saver: No restrictions. Lock KAIRO in Recents (pull down on its card).</string>
    <string name="oem_steps_vivo">i Manager → App manager → Autostart: allow KAIRO. Settings → Battery → Background power consumption: allow KAIRO high background usage.</string>
    <string name="oem_steps_oppo">Settings → Apps → KAIRO → Battery: Allow background activity and Allow auto launch. Lock KAIRO in Recents.</string>
    <string name="oem_steps_oneplus">Settings → Apps → KAIRO → Battery: Don\'t optimise / Unrestricted. Settings → Battery → Advanced optimisation: turn off Deep optimisation.</string>
    <string name="oem_steps_samsung">Settings → Battery → Background usage limits: remove KAIRO from Sleeping and Deep sleeping apps and add it to Never sleeping apps.</string>

